Package: openwrt-captive-monitor-docker
Version: 2026.2.19.8-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: docker.io | docker-ce
Maintainer: OpenWrt Captive Monitor Team <nahual15@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/nagual2/openwrt-captive-monitor
Description: Captive Portal Daemon (Docker version)
 Automatic captive portal detection and authentication daemon
 for Conn4-based captive portals (e.g. Leonardo Hotels).
 .
 This package installs a Docker-based daemon with Chrome and
 Selenium for browser-based portal authentication.
 .
 Requires Docker to be installed and running.
 Recommended: 4GB+ RAM, x86-64 architecture.
